---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="Junior & Senior Representation - Omagh Harriers AC"
    description="Policies for club representation at events"
>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-black to-gray-900 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <a
            href="/policies"
            class="inline-flex items-center text-amber hover:text-yellow-400 transition-colors mb-4"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
          </svg>
          Back to Policies
        </a>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Junior & Senior Representation</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300">
        Funding Policy for Junior & Senior Athletes
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <!-- Objective -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Objective</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">This policy outlines the procedure for applying for financial support for junior and senior athletes selected
            for N. Ireland/Ireland individual and/or team events (e.g., Cross country, London mini marathon, ultra
            marathon).</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Omagh Harriers A.C. is committed to supporting its members by providing funding/contribution, up to a maximum
            of <strong>&pound;160.00</strong> per athlete per calendar year.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Eligibility Criteria -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Eligibility Criteria</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Applicants must be current members of Omagh Harriers A.C.</li>
            <li>Funding is available exclusively for official representation at national events.</li>
            <li>Applications must be submitted within the specified timeframe of four weeks in advance of the event in
              which the funding is sought.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Application Process -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Application Process</h3>
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700">
            <li><strong>Submission</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>Athletes must complete and submit a funding application email, providing details of the event,
                  associated costs, and proof of selection for representation.
                </li>
                <li>Applications must be submitted no later than four weeks before the event.</li>
                <li>If selection occurs at short notice, applications must be submitted within one week of notification of
                  selection.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Approval</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>The committee will review all applications within two weeks of submission or within a reasonable
                  period thereafter.
                </li>
                <li>Approval will be based on eligibility, the number of applications received, and available funding.
                </li>
                <li>Decisions will be communicated to applicants in writing.</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <!-- Reimbursement Process -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Reimbursement Process</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Approved funding will be reimbursed after the event upon submission of receipts for eligible expenses,
              including travel, accommodation, and entry fees.
            </li>
            <li>Receipts must be submitted to the committee within two weeks after the event.</li>
            <li>Reimbursement will be processed via bank transfer or cheque within two weeks of receipt verification.</li>
            <li>A <strong>maximum of &pound;160 per athlete per calendar year</strong> is available.</li>
            <li>Funding is non-transferable and cannot exceed the actual costs incurred.</li>
            <li>Failure to submit receipts within the specified timeframe may result in forfeiture of funding.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Review and Monitoring -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Review and Monitoring</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">This policy will be reviewed annually by the committee to ensure it aligns with the club&rsquo;s objectives
            and financial capacity.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Omagh Harriers A.C. is proud to support its junior and senior athletes in
            their pursuit of excellence and encourages all eligible members to apply for funding in accordance with this
            policy.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>Approved by</strong>: Omagh Harriers A.C. Committee<br/><strong>Date</strong>: December 2024</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Logo -->
        <div class="mt-12 text-center">
          <figure><img
              src="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-9.png?w=408"
              sizes="(max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px"
              srcset="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-9.png 408w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-9.png?w=150 150w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-9.png?w=300 300w"
              alt="" width="408" height="160"
          /></figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
